\par\par \b \uc2  Thai Baht Ends Slightly Down, But Is Expected To Resume Rise \b0\par\par\uc2 332 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Oktober 1998\par 13:48\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK (Dow Jones)--The Thai baht (THB) closed slightly lower against the dollar in Asian trade Friday, but analysts and government officials expect it to rise further following U.S. interest rate cuts Thursday. \par \par \uc2  The dollar traded at THB37.925 late Friday, above Thursday's close of THB37.905. The baht is hovering near its high for 1998. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. Federal Reserve cut the Federal funds target rate by 25 basis points, to 5%, and the discount rate by 25 basis points, to 4.75%, attributing the move to concern that growing caution by lenders could hurt U.S. consumption in the future. \par \par \uc2  The move sent most Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  higher. The dollar hit an intraday low of THB37.810, before recouping losses in the afternoon. \par \par \uc2  A dealer at a U.S. bank attributed the baht's pullback Friday to closing of short positions in Singapore ahead of a market holiday there Monday. He said he expects hedge funds to continue selling dollars for baht, and said he expects the dollar to drop to THB37.70 Monday, which would mark a 12-month high. \par \par \uc2  A dealer at Banque Nationale de Paris said the baht should be higher already. \par \par \uc2  "The baht could have been at 37 to dollar since last week if there were no \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  then," he said. \par \par \uc2  Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Chatu Mongol Sonakul concurred Friday, saying the baht would have risen further against the dollar in recent weeks had the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  not acted. \par \par \uc2  Chatu Mongol declined to say what the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had done, or to characterize the actions as \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . He said previously that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would act to slow rapid movements in the exchange rate, but not to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  against market trends. \par \par \uc2  Finance Minister Tarrin Nimmanahaeminda said Friday he expects the baht to continue to strengthen as the U.S. eases monetary policy. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 16-10-98 \par \par \uc2  1148GMT \par \par \uc2  1028 1861 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010917duag006vv\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
