aid: "The stronger baht shows investors have higher confidence in the Thai economy, and they will likely bring in more investment." \par \par \uc2  -By Sinfah Tunsarawuth; 662-266-0744; stunsarawuth@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 08-10-98 \par \par \uc2  0705GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010920dua8005i0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
