\par\par \b \uc2  SE Asian  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2  -5: Investors Bullish On Baht's Fortunes \b0\par\par\uc2 261 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Oktober 1998\par 13:17\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Against the Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the dollar is trading at 38.40 baht (THB), down from THB38.87 late Wednesday. "Investors are confident in the baht's strength at the moment," said a trader at a U.S. bank, adding that the dollar's fall against the baht has been muted, disappointing the market somewhat. \par \par \uc2  Traders have said during recent sessions that they expected the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market when the U.S. dollar fell below THB38.50. \par \par \uc2  "But with the U.S. dollar falling so much against the yen, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  until the dollar falls below THB38," said the trader at the Thai bank. \par \par \uc2  The Philippine peso (PHP), as well as North Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  such as the New Taiwan dollar and South Korean won (KRW) are also heading higher in late trading. The U.S. dollar is trading at PHP43.375, down from PHP43.68 Wednesday; at NT$32.917, down from NT$33.346; and at KRW1,360, down from KRW1,380 Wednesday. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "The New Taiwan dollar is highly correlated to the yen because of the\par two countries' export baskets," said Mcfarland. "The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has\par climbed as sentiment for the yen has become positive, but, remember, the\par reverse is also true and there will be considerable downside in both\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ."\par    (The chart the normally accompanies this \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  comment\par was unavailable Thursday.)\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -By Brian Truscott; 65 421 4800; btruscott@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires  10-08-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0717EDT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1136 4250 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020010916dua802dm6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
