\par\par \b \uc2  SE Asian  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2  Stronger As Yen Soars Against U.S. Dlr \b0\par\par\uc2 274 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Oktober 1998\par 04:13\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  SINGAPORE (Dow Jones)--Southeast Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  are stronger against the U.S. dollar in early trading Thursday, following Wednesday's massive dollar sell-off, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. dollar fell as low as Y119.60 overnight before bouncing back to Y121.35 at 0210 GMT (10:10 p.m. Wednesday EDT). That's more than a Y13 fall over two days. \par \par \uc2  Regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  have followed suit, but the lack of liquidity in Southeast Asian markets has limited the \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 ' reaction to the yen spike, traders said. \par \par \uc2  "The market still has some U.S. dollar selling to do, especially for those who missed the opportunity to sell last night," said a trader at a Thai bank. \par \par \uc2  He expects the Thai baht to continue strengthening throughout the day, because the Bank of Thailand - like other central banks in the region - is comfortable with domestic \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  movements as long as they are in line with overall \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  movements, especially in the yen. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. dollar is trading at 38.48 baht (THB), down from THB38.87 at the same time Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  "Investors are becoming increasingly confident in the baht," said a trader at a Singapore bank. \par \par \uc2  Traders have said during recent sessions that they expected the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market when the U.S. dollar fell below THB38.50. "But with the U.S. dollar falling so much against the yen, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  until the dollar falls below THB38," said the trader at the Thai bank. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires  10-07-98 \par \par \uc2  2213EDT \par \par \uc2  1136 4250 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020010916dua802dh0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
