\par\par \b \uc2  Thai Central Bk To Boost Econ, Let Mkt Set Exchange Rate \b0\par\par\uc2  By Thomas Fox \par \uc2 294 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Juli 1998\par 19:59\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK (Dow Jones)--Bank of Thailand Governor Chatu Mongol Sonakul said late Wednesday that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is lowering interest rates and injecting liquidity to promote economic recovery, abandoning a policy of high interest rates to support the baht. \par \par \uc2  Chatu Mongol told the Foreign Correspondents Club of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets only to smooth out unusual movements in trading, "not to change a trend." \par \par \uc2  "When there are abnormal purchases we will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to make the cost of abnormal trading more expensive," by raising repurchase rates, he said. \par \par \uc2  Previously, high interest rates and sometimes controls on the flow of baht to offshore markets had been used to reduce the supply of baht to speculators, he said. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  studies showed that a one percentage point increase in repurchase rates attracts 10.4 billion baht (THB) in funds from financial institutions that would otherwise be available in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, the governor said. \par \par \uc2  But Chatu Mongol acknowledged that the only effective defense of the baht over time is prudent management of monetary policy, timely exchange rate \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and development of infrastructure. \par \par \uc2  Increasing short-term interest rates is the most powerful tool at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's disposal, but if they are too high for too long, everyone gets hurt, he said. \par \par \uc2  Loans cannot be repaid unless interest rates come down, and non-performing loans must fall if investors are to bring sufficient capital into the country. \par \par \uc2  "If we (still) have 35% non-performing loans in two years time, there will be nobody who will come in with new money," only to have it wasted, he said. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 08-07-98 \par \par \uc2  1759GMT \par \par \uc2  4214 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du7805uux\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
