\par\par \b \uc2  Thai baht lower early as yen dips against dollar. \b0\par\par\uc2 277 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Juni 1998\par 04:37\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BANGKOK, June 5 (Reuters) - The Thai baht dipped early on Friday under pressure from dollar demand from offshore players as the U.S. unit strengthened against majors, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  But they said the downside was seen limited due to fears that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  might step in to shore up the baht at any time. The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  confirmed that it had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market intermittently on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  The baht was quoted at 42.85/42.95 to the dollar at 0230 GMT versus 42.50/42.60 per dollar late on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  "Dollar buying from offshore is quite active this morning and some of it is believed to be linked to speculation," said a dealer at a European bank. \par \par \uc2  "Fundamentally, uncertainties over the yen will continue to cloud the reginal \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , including the baht," he said. \par \par \uc2  Bank of Thailand Governor Chatu Mongol Sonakul also said that a group of speculators had been at work against the baht which plunged below 43 per dollar on Thursday in unusually higher volume. \par \par \uc2  "The move propped up the baht on Thursday. I think the downside of the baht will be limited as players will be cautious once the baht dips below 43," said a dealer at a major local bank. \par \par \uc2  Overnight interbank rates were steady at 19.50-20.00 percent early. Offshore one month forward swap premiums were quoted at 115/125 satangs per dollar against 110/120 satangs late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Onshore premiums of the same tenure were quoted at 45/50 satangs. \par \par \uc2  - Bangkok newsroom (662) 253-5000 \par \par \uc2  - email:bangkok.newsroom@reuters.com. \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010925du6503lz5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
