\par\par \b \uc2  Thai baht firms late on c.bank  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  talk. \b0\par\par\uc2 348 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Juni 1998\par 12:09\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BANGKOK, June 4 (Reuters) - The Thai baht firmed late on Thursday, spiking well below the 43 per dollar level in late dealings, amid talk that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may have \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on its behalf, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The Thai unit gained more than one baht, after hitting an intra-day low of 43.65 per dollar earlier, when it was quoted at 42.50/42.60 to the dollar at 0955 GMT. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the baht's slide earlier in the day was caused by a speculative attack by foreign hedge funds. \par \par \uc2  Dollar sales emerged after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's governor Chatu Mongol Sonakul said the bank was ready to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prop up the diving baht, they added. \par \par \uc2  "We heard market talk that the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  briefly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the afternoon. I don't know whether it's true but the rumour prompted some dollar sales," said a dealer at a major foreign bank. \par \par \uc2  There was no comment from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Some dealers said there was also talk that some foreign investors had tried to pressure the baht down so that they could buy it back at a cheaper level in preparation to buy domestic government bonds expected to be issued later this month. \par \par \uc2  "That might explain why the baht failed to track the relatively stable yen on Wednesday," he said. \par \par \uc2  "Actually, some in the market are still long dollars. The baht should not drop this low, not when the regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  are steady...it could be temporary," said another dealer. \par \par \uc2  The overnight interbank rate was quoted higher at 19.50-20.00 percent by local banka compared with 19.00 this morning. \par \par \uc2  The rise was in line with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's one-day bond repurchase market rate which closed 100 basis points up at 19.00 percent in the afternoon. \par \par \uc2  Offshore one-month forward swap premiums rose to 110/120 satangs per dollar compared with 95/105 satangs this morning. \par \par \uc2  - Anchalee Koetsawang (662) 253-5000 \par \par \uc2  - email:bangkok.newsroom@reuters.com. \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010925du6403phc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
