\par\par \b \uc2  Thai c. bank confirms baht  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 298 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Juni 1998\par 15:32\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BANGKOK, June 4 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  chief Chatu Mongol Sonakul confirmed that the bank had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  intermittently in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to stabilise the baht which plummeted below the 43 per dollar level on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  He also said he had received a report that a group of speculators had been at work in the market bringing the baht down. \par \par \uc2  The weakening baht firmed sharply in the afternoon on Thursday after Chatu Mongol vowed to defend the baht with \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Dealers in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market said there was talk of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  which had enabled the Thai unit to firm to 42.23/42.43 in late dealings after it had earlier hit a traded day low of 43.65. \par \par \uc2  The volume in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market was much bigger today than usual, Chatu Mongol told reporters. \par \par \uc2  "They are seeing that Thailand may have some problems, such as politics, that people may have started to be unhappy with the government. So they think it is the right time to get in and others will follow suit," he said of the speculators. \par \par \uc2  "We entered the market from time to time today," he added about \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prop up the baht. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had also allowed a rise in its one-day repurchase rate, he said. The repo rate closed at 19 percent, up one percent from 18 percent on Thursday morning. \par \par \uc2  The baht last traded at 43.06 on March 11. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has lost nearly 39 percent of its value since it was floated last July. \par \par \uc2  Analysts expect the baht to slide to about 45 to the dollar in the near term, given its break through the 40-level recently, and because of negative regional economic factors. \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010925du6403nrq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
