\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Thailand \highlight\uc2  Ctrl Bank Uses Verbal  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  To Boost Baht \b0\par\par\uc2  By Joseph Rebello \par \uc2 331 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 Dezember 1997\par 12:56\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK (AP-Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , having nearly exhausted its war chest of foreign-\b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves to prop up the baht this year, has begun to use a cheaper defense, bankers say: the threat of prosecution. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Thailand said Wednesday it increased its vigilance of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  transactions to stamp out speculation that may have caused the baht to fall to a historic low this week. A spokeswoman said the bank had toughened enforcement of regulations imposed in May to curb speculators. \par \par \uc2  'We're asking for more information on \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  transactions, and why they're needed,' said the spokeswoman, Duangmanee Vonpradhip. 'We'll warn them first (if regulations are violated) and try to get their cooperation. After that we have to take legal action.' \par \par \uc2  But several Thai and foreign bankers said they had detected no additional scrutiny from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  or from other regulators. They deemed the announcement a 'psychological ploy' to help stabilize the baht, which fell Tuesday to an all-time low of 49.50 to the dollar. The baht recovered to finish Wednesday at 46.90 to the dollar in domestic spot trading. \par \par \uc2  The baht may not have needed much help from regulators Wednesday. Although many \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's tough talk contributed slightly to its rise, they said most of the boost was provided by the yen's surge against the U.S. dollar. The dollar slumped late Wednesday to 126.85 yen from 130.80 yen earlier in the day, boosting many Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  as it fell. \par \par \uc2  'The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's use of verbal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is probably the first time it has used an opportunity created by the weakness of the dollar to apply psychological pressure to boost the baht,' said Ananda Bhaumik, a treasury consultant at Thailand's Laem Thong Bank PCL. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 17-12-97 \par \par \uc2  1156GMT \par \par \uc2  1144 4279 55129 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtch09pc4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
