\par\par \b \uc2  Thailand Baht Ends At New Low After Testing 49.50 To Dlr \b0\par\par\uc2 323 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Dezember 1997\par 11:57\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK (AP-Dow Jones)--The Thai baht slumped to an all-time low of 49.50 to the dollar in intraday trading in the domestic spot market Tuesday, although it perked up slightly at the close of trading after \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was mixed in the swap market, where investors make agreements to buy and sell baht at fixed prices at fixed times in the future. One- and six-month premiums were down, although the two-month premium rose. \par \par \uc2  At the close of trading Tuesday, the dollar was 48.35 baht in the domestic spot market, up from 47.50 baht late Monday. At that level, the Thai baht is down 46.5% against the dollar since July 2, when the country abandoned its fixed exchange rate system. In offshore trading, the dollar closed at 47.15 baht, unchanged from late Monday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers attributed the slump to growing fears that the government will decree a halt to all repayment of public and private sector debt. The Thai government has said it is not considering a debt moratorium because Thai corporations so far have been able to refinance most of their debt. \par \par \uc2  But \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers said Thai corporations remain panicky about the dollar's ascent and are scrambling to buy dollars to repay foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  debts. That, in turn, has driven the baht lower. \par \par \uc2  Already many Thai corporations have been pushed to the brink of insolvency by the baht's slide. 'There's a big fear of defaults,' a dealer at the Bank of Tokyo said. \par \par \uc2  He said, however, that \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  helped stabilize the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold dollars to foreign banks to strengthen the Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . A spokeswoman for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  couldn't be reached for comment. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 16-12-97 \par \par \uc2  1057GMT \par \par \uc2  1028 1861 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtcg09naf\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
