\par\par \b \uc2  Thai baht firmer late after  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  action. \b0\par\par\uc2 351 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Dezember 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BANGKOK, Dec 16 (Reuters) - The Thai baht firmed in early evening trade on Tuesday as \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  helped bolster the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's action sparked some profit taking, and a mild rebound in regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  following the Indonesian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's support for the rupiah earlier, also helped steel the baht in late trade, they added. \par \par \uc2  After a see saw day the baht was quoted late at 47.60/48.10 per dollar. It had opened this morning at an all time low of 48.45/48.95 and weakened further to trade at an all-time low of 49.35 in mid-morning before dealers said they believed the Bank of Thailand stepped in. \par \par \uc2  "It was very volatile, up and down. At first I thought it was demand from corporates that pushed the baht weaker and then after it broke the 49 level, I think exporters came to sell U.S. dollars and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market," said a dealer at a local bank. \par \par \uc2  "That pushed the baht much stronger, to a low for today of about 47.40. After that I think some corporates were buying back and pushed the rate back again," he said. \par \par \uc2  A recovery in regionals and some profit-taking helped pare late losses and may give the baht a steadier tone on Wednesday, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The volatility helped many players end the day with square positions, dealers said. They said \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  may have amounted to $10 million with a moderate overall volumes. \par \par \uc2  Locally one month forward swap rates quoted at 38/43 satang per dollar against 39/44 earlier. The baht also firmed to 46.90/47.20 per dollar offshore from 47.30/47.50 this morning. \par \par \uc2  Large local banks quoted overnight interbank rates of 23-24 percent, unchanged from the morning. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's one-day repurchase rate closed at 25 percent against 23 in the morning. \par \par \uc2  -- James Mclean (662) 652-0642 \par \par \uc2  -- e-mail: bangkok.newsroom@reuters.com \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011003dtcg0130h\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
