\par\par \b \uc2  Thai baht slide ebbs late on  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  defence. \b0\par\par\uc2 392 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 Dezember 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BANGKOK, Dec 3 (Reuters) - The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the spot market in the afternoon session on Wednesday and succeeded in halting a slide in the Thai baht after it tumbled to a record low against the dollar, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  helped the baht to recover and be quoted at 42.58/42.68 per dollar in late afternoon against a record low earlier in the day of 42.90/43.10 per dollar in the onshore market. The day's low was recorded at 42.95 \par \par \uc2  "I think in the afternoon the baht is stronger because the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market," said a dealer at a local bank. \par \par \uc2  Dealers at other banks said they suspected some limited \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the spot market was responsible for the baht's late resurgence. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Chaiyawat Wibulswasdi had earlier urged the market to remain calm as the South Korean won's problems sent regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  into a tailspin and Thai corporates bought dollars to service foreign debt repayments falling due, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "I think some corporates were panicked by the market because the baht slipped so fast and they are thinking about covering their positions in case the baht weakens again to 45 or 50," said the local bank dealer. \par \par \uc2  "There are internal and external problems for the Thai baht. Externally there is the Korean merchant banks and that might be asked to close. That has affected the won, the ringgit and the Thai baht," he added. \par \par \uc2  Internally there were concerns about a government announcement due on Monday regarding the fate of 58 suspended finance companies, dealers added. \par \par \uc2  A decision on the firms' future is due on Monday. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  should encourage some profit taking on Thursday and help neutralise dollar demand ahead of a bank holiday weekend, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  In the offshore market the baht quoted late at 42.38/42.58 per dollar, off an intraday low of 42.75. \par \par \uc2  The domestic one month swap premium edged up to 32/37 satang per dollar against 30.5/35 in the morning. \par \par \uc2  Large local banks quoted the interbank overnight rate at 22 percent, unchanged from the morning, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  --James Mclean (662) 652-0642 \par \par \uc2  --e-mail: bangkok.newsroom@reuters.com \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011003dtc301ifc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
