\par\par \b \uc2  Bank Of Thailand/Exporters -2: Must Help Stabilize Market \b0\par\par\uc2 253 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 November 1997\par 08:16\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK (AP-Dow Jones)--The governor of Thailand's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Wednesday urged Thai exporters to sell dollars they have been hoarding, saying their help was necessary to help stabilize the Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The call from Chaiyawat Wibulswasdi came as the U.S. dollar rose above 40 baht for the first time in two weeks amid a rush by Thai corporations to repay foreign-\b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  debt. Dealers said demand for dollars was intensified by the slump of the South Korean won, which has sparked worries that that country may also need a bailout by the International Monetary Fund. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , once vigorously \b \highlight22\uc2 interventionist\b0 \highlight\uc2  in defense of its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , now only occasionally expresses public disapproval of movements in the Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  Around 0632 GMT (1:32 a.m. EST), the dollar was at 40.30 baht in the domestic spot market, up from 39.875 baht at the close of trading Friday. \par \par \uc2  Thai economists have said the country, now in recession for the first time in more than a decade, cannot afford to have the dollar above 40 baht for any length of time. Chaiyawat said exporters had been hoarding dollars on expectations that the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  will continue to rise against the baht. They should do their part to help strengthen the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , he said. \par \par \uc2  'This is important to stabilize the markets,' he said. \par \par \uc2  -By Joe Rebello; 662 267-9883 \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 19-11-97 \par \par \uc2  0716GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtbj08tgy\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
