\par\par \b \uc2  Bank of  \highlight22\uc2 Thailand intervenes \highlight\uc2  to prop up baht. \b0\par\par\uc2 210 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Oktober 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BANGKOK, Oct 30 (Reuters) - The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  started to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Thursday to prop up the baht as the unit was seen as too low, a senior \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  official said. \par \par \uc2  Kiartisak Meechareon, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  assistant governor, said the baht had "overshot" but declined to elaborate further or give details of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The baht plunged to 39.95 to the dollar at 0730 GMT before firming to 39.77 baht. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the baht dropped sharply on strong demand for dollars from corporates which either sought to pay foreign debt or repatriate funds home. \par \par \uc2  "We have to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  because the baht seemed to have overshot. There is no \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the world that is not concerned about its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," Kiartisak said. \par \par \uc2  "The government also uses other long term measures to support the baht, such as the credit expansion to boost the export industry. Once the exports improve, the baht will be more stabilised," he said. \par \par \uc2  The government on Thursday increased the credit to the export sector to 33 billion baht ($846 million) from 26 billion baht. ($1 = 39 baht) \par \par \uc2  -- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642 \par \par \uc2  Email:bangkok.newsroom@reuters.com \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011003dtau03irb\p