\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Thailand \highlight\uc2  Baht/Ends -2:  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Helps Only Briefly \b0\par\par\uc2 194 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Oktober 1997\par 12:11\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which has said it would stop \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  after a futile battle against speculators this year, on Thursday said it resumed \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . News of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which came when the dollar was around 39.95 baht at mid-afternoon, briefly perked up the baht. But the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  declined again just before trading closed. \par \par \uc2  'There's no \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  that is not concerned about the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  level,' said Kiettisak Meecharoen, an assistant governor at the bank who announced the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . He declined to provide details of the nature of the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  set its reference rate for the dollar at 39.293 baht Thursday, up from 39.003 baht Wednesday. The reference rate is a weighted average of rates charged by Thai commercial banks the previous day. It serves as a benchmark for domestic \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Interbank rates were mostly stable. The overnight and call interbank\par rates closed at 12%, compared with 11% to 14% Wednesday.\par -By Joseph Rebello; 662-266-0744; jrebello@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 30-10-97\