\par\par \b \uc2  Thailand  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Sells Dlrs To Prop Up Baht - Dealers \b0\par\par\uc2 312 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 September 1997\par 10:20\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK (AP-Dow Jones)--Thailand's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Wednesday sold dollars in the domestic spot market to prop up the weakening baht after the Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  hit a historic low against the dollar, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers weren't able to specify the amount of the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . However, a dealer at a U.S. bank in Bangkok said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's move helped pull the dollar off its record high of 37.50 baht reached around 0630 GMT (2:30 a.m. EDT). \par \par \uc2  At 0800 GMT (4:00 a.m. EDT), the dollar is at 36.75 baht, up from 35.15 baht at the close of trading Tuesday. A \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spokesman wasn't available for comment. Chaiyawat Wibulswasdi, governor of the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 , declined to confirm or deny an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Dealers attributed the baht's slide to Thai corporations' worries about their foreign debt exposure. Thai corporations owed around $73 billion in foreign debts, most of which is unhedged. Since the Bank of Thailand abandoned its fixed exchange-rate system July 2, the baht has fallen more than 28%. \par \par \uc2  'Many people decided to dump the baht as soon as the dollar broke above 35 baht, which is the level never seen before in history,' said a dealer at Hongkong & Shanghai Banking Corp Ltd. 'They were afraid that the dollar will rise to as high as 40 baht.' \par \par \uc2  Some dealers also attributed the dollar's retreat from its historic high partly to profit-taking after the dollar rose 4% since Friday. \par \par \uc2  'Some investors sold the dollar at 37 baht and waited to buy it back when it fell below that level,' said a dealer at Citibank in Bangkok. 'There's definitely profit-taking going on.' \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 03-09-97 \par \par \uc2  0820GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt9306gcl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
