\par\par \b \uc2  Thai baht dips to new low despite  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 362 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 September 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BANGKOK, Sept 3 (Reuter) - The Thai baht plunged to new lows in late trade on Wednesday in the domestic market despite \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stall the baht's slide, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  stepped in the market in early afternoon. But the baht continued to fall further after the dollar selling by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had dried up," said one senior dealer at a foreign bank. \par \par \uc2  The baht dropped to new low of 37.60/37.90 near the close onshore after the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  pushed the baht up to 35.50/35.60 in early afternoon trade. \par \par \uc2  The baht was traded at around 35.70/35.90 in early morning. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said most importers and borrowers of foreign loans were bidding wildly for the dollar today on fear of the baht's further weakness. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Chaiyawat Wibulswasdi said on Wednesday the market should not panic over the baht's sharp slide, saying its setback was temporary before the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  regained its stability. \par \par \uc2  "(The market) should not over react to the baht's slide. The authorities would move to prevent market panic and stop its sharp fall," Chaiyawat told a news conference. \par \par \uc2  The governor declined to indicate the level at which the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to defend the baht, saying it should be determined by the market. \par \par \uc2  Chaiyawat said the baht's Wednesday record low was partly due to the dollar's strong rally against most \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . He said the baht's latest decline was proportionately smaller than those sustained by other Southeast Asian \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  In the offshore market, the baht was quoted at 35.35/35.65 late compared with 34.88/34.98 in early morning trade. \par \par \uc2  The one-month baht/dollar swap premium was quoted at 40/50 satangs late in the onshore market and 37/47 offshore. \par \par \uc2  The overnight interbank rate jumped to 24 percent in late trade from 20 percent early as heavy dollar buying squeezed liquidity in the banking system, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  -- Anuchit Nguyen (662) 652-0642 \par \par \uc2  -- e-mail: bangkok.newsroom@reuters.com \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt93009b1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
