\par\par \b \uc2  Thailand/ \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Gov -3: BIS Provides 'Bridge' Credit \b0\par\par\uc2 246 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 August 1997\par 07:42\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Investors in the swap markets make agreements to buy and sell baht for a fixed price at a specified time in the future. During a series of speculative attacks on the Thai baht this year, the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it '\b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 ' in those markets by borrowing the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , although it never said how much. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  thwarted speculators and shored up the country's foreign reserves in the short term. But because the reserves data didn't reflect the bank's swap commitments, investors began to lose faith in the published reserve numbers, analysts said. Continued \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  eventually became unaffordable, forcing the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  on July 2 to abandon its fixed-exchange rate system, letting the baht drop 20% in value against the dollar. \par \par \uc2  Analysts have said the $16.7 billion aid package organized by the IMF will protect the country against a drain in foreign reserves. The IMF alone has contributed $4 billion in a 34-month standby credit agreement with Thailand. Other countries and international agencies, including Japan, China, and the Asian Development Bank, have also contributed. \par \par \uc2  Chaiyawat said Thursday Thailand had also obtained $1 billion in 'bridge financing' from the Bank for International Settlements, the Swiss-based organization. The BIS credit will be used in the event of delays in receiving funds from contributors to the IMF-sponsored rescue package, he said. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 21-08-97 \par \par \uc2  0542GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt8l065gj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
