\par\par \b \uc2  Bank of  \highlight22\uc2 Thailand intervenes \highlight\uc2  to prop up baht - trade. \b0\par\par\uc2 168 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Juli 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BANGKOK, July 24 (Reuter) - The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  is believed to have \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the domestic \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Thursday to prop up the sliding baht which earlier in the day plunged to a record low, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "We suspect that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  entered the market once the baht hit the 32.60 level," said a dealer at a major Thai bank. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  seemed to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  intermittently and could still be in the market," she added. \par \par \uc2  The baht plunged to a new record low of 32.70 baht per dollar on Thursday morning. \par \par \uc2  After the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , it edged up and hovered around 31.90 baht per dollar at 0500 GMT. \par \par \uc2  A \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  official declined to confirm or deny the market talk. \par \par \uc2  "It is normal practice that we remain discreet on the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's moves. But we are monitoring the market closely," she told Reuters. \par \par \uc2  -- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt7o02467\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
