\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Thailand \highlight\uc2  Baht Ends Higher On  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 283 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Juli 1997\par 13:19\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK (AP-Dow Jones)--The Thai baht recovered slightly from an all-time low against the U.S. dollar Thursday, closing higher on what was believed to be \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  efforts to shore up confidence in the bruised \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The baht also strengthened in the swap market, where investors agree to buy and sell baht at specified times in the future. Swap premiums eased. \par \par \uc2  At the close of Asian trading Thursday, the dollar was at 32.05 baht in the domestic market, down from a record high of 32.30 baht Wednesday. In the offshore market, however, the dollar rose to 31.98 baht compared with 31.55 baht at Wednesday's close. \par \par \uc2  'It looked like there was some \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 . I think it sold at least $100 million through the large banks,' one dealer said. 'Thai companies have been buying up dollars to hedge their foreign borrowing if the baht drops further. The Bank of Thailand is anxious to restore their confidence, so it can't let the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  drop too far.' \par \par \uc2  Dealers said Thai corporates were still buying dollars, though. The companies have an estimated $45 billion in short-term loans to cover, and the cost of that has soared since July 2's effective devaluation of the baht. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Thailand set its reference rate for the dollar at 32.108 baht, up from 30.842 baht Wednesday. The reference rate is a weighted average of rates charged by Thai commercial banks the previous day. It serves as a benchmark for domestic \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 24-07-97 \par \par \uc2  1119GMT \par \par \uc2  1028 1861 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt7o05hd2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
