\par\par \b \uc2  Thailand Baht At Record Low Mid-Morning In Local Mkt \b0\par\par\uc2 297 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Juli 1997\par 05:02\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK (AP-Dow Jones)--The Thai baht has hit a record low in domestic spot trading mid-morning Thursday as Thai corporations continue to buy dollars on expectations that the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  will continue to appreciate. \par \par \uc2  The Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , however, has strengthened in the swap market, where investors make agreements to buy and sell baht at specified times in the future. Swap premiums have declined. \par \par \uc2  Around 0240 GMT (10:40 p.m. EDT), the dollar is at 32.80 baht in the domestic spot market, up from 32.30 baht at the close of trading Wednesday, a historic high, according to dealers. In the offshore market, the dollar is at 32.15 baht, up from 31.55 baht at the close of trading Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers attributed the baht's slump to a rush by corporations to buy dollars to pay off foreign-\b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  loans amid fears that the dollar will rise. The U.K. investment bank BZW has predicted the dollar will peak at 38 baht within 12 months, reaching 35 baht by the end of 1997. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  has not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to defend the baht, as it was rumored to have done Wednesday. 'But if the dollar hits 33 baht today, I think you'll see \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,' a dealer at a European bank said. A spokesman for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  couldn't be reached for comment. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Thailand set its reference rate at 32.108 baht, up from 30.842 baht Wednesday. The reference rate is a weighted average of rates charged by Thai commercial banks the previous day. It serves as a benchmark for domestic \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 24-07-97 \par \par \uc2  0302GMT \par \par \uc2  1028 1861 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt7o05e4i\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
