\par\par \b \uc2  Thailand: Baht Ends Lower Amid Heavy Corporate Dlr-Buying \b0\par\par\uc2 289 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Juli 1997\par 13:02\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK (AP-Dow Jones)--The Thai baht slumped in domestic and offshore trading Tuesday as Thai corporations scrambled to buy the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  on fears of continued dollar appreciation, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is also weakened in the swap market, where investors make agreements to buy and sell baht at specified times in the future. Swap premiums rose amid the dollar-buying. \par \par \uc2  At the close of Asian trading Tuesday, the dollar was at 31 baht in the domestic market, up from 30.45 baht at the close of trading Friday. In the offshore market, the dollar was at 30.60 baht, up from 30.45 baht late Monday. The domestic baht market was closed for a holiday Monday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers attributed the baht's decline to persistent dollar-buying by Thai corporations, which have an estimated $45 billion in short-term loans. 'It's pure demand from the corporate side,' a dealer at a European bank said. 'Corporations think the dollar is going to rise further, so they want to pay off their loans now.' \par \par \uc2  The dollar is now well above the 30-baht level at which the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  has said it would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to defend the baht. On Tuesday, however, dealers said there was no trace of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . 'Not even a shadow,' one dealer said. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Thailand set its reference rate for the dollar at 30.370 baht Tuesday, up from 30.127 baht Friday. The reference rate is a weighted average of rates charged by Thai commercial banks the previous day. It serves as a benchmark for domestic \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 22-07-97 \par \par \uc2  1102GMT \par \par \uc2  1028 1861 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt7m05b6l\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
