\par\par \b \uc2  Thailand Baht Ends Lower As Corporate Dlr-Buying Resumes \b0\par\par\uc2 243 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Juli 1997\par 13:00\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK (AP-Dow Jones)--The Thai baht fell against the dollar in domestic trading late Wednesday as corporates resumed buying dollars to hedge against possible future declines in the value of the baht, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  also weakened in the swap market where investors agree to buy and sell baht at specified times in the future. Swap premiums rose as market players continued to worry over the strength of the baht. \par \par \uc2  At the close of domestic trading Wednesday, the dollar rose to 30.06 baht compared with 29.975 baht Tuesday. In the offshore market, the dollar was at 29.89 baht, up from 29.70 baht Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Thailand, meanwhile, set its reference rate at 29.967 baht, down from 30.348 baht Tuesday. The reference rate is a weighted average of rates charged by Thai commercial banks the previous day. It serves as a benchmark for domestic \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading. \par \par \uc2  'Corporate clients were buying dollars,' said a dealer at a Japanese bank. 'Thailand's current account deficit means there's not enough capital flowing into the country and will likely mean the baht will decline further.' \par \par \uc2  Dealers were uncertain as to whether the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stabilize the baht. On Monday, the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it wouldn't let the Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  slip below 30 baht. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 16-07-97 \par \par \uc2  1100GMT \par \par \uc2  1028 1861 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt7g056x1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
