\par\par \b \uc2  Thai baht, interbank rate steady in late trade. \b0\par\par\uc2 290 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Juli 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  BANGKOK, July 15 (Reuter) - The Thai baht was steady in late quiet trade onshore on Tuesday, after being capped at the strong resistance level of around 30 baht per dollar, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  "The market was very quiet. The baht was traded at around 29.95-30.00 throughout the day," said one dealer at a European bank. \par \par \uc2  The baht was quoted at 29.95/29.97 to the dollar late onshore compared with 29.90/30.00 in early dealings. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of Thailand on Tuesday announced that the weighted average interbank exchange rate was 30.348 per dollar against 29.945 on Monday. \par \par \uc2  The reference rate is the average rate traded the previous day. It has been announced daily by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  since the baht was floated on July 2. \par \par \uc2  The dealer said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has apparently tried to cap the baht/dollar trade at the 30.00 level, but no significant \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was seen on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The baht tumbled to a new record low of 30.80 in early Monday trade in the domestic market. \par \par \uc2  But the baht recovered significantly later after the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  and issued a statement that it would take any necessary action to stabilise the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  In the offshore market, the baht was quoted at 29.70/29.90 late against 29.65/29.85 in early morning. \par \par \uc2  The baht/dollar one-month swap premium was at 28/33 satangs per dollar late in onshore market and 70/80 satangs in the offshore market. \par \par \uc2  The overnight interbank rate was steady at 18-20 percent, unchanged from early morning trade. \par \par \uc2  -- Anuchit Nguyen (662) 652-0642 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt7f02jms\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
