\par\par \b \uc2  Thailand: Shares Lower At Midday; SET Down 8.05 Points \b0\par\par\uc2 273 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Juli 1997\par 07:54\par \uc2  Dow Jones Asian Equities Report \par \uc2 AER\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK (Dow Jones)--Thai stock prices are lower at midday Monday on worries that the Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  could see further declines against the dollar after the Philippines and Indonesia loosened up their own \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  regimes, dealer said. \par \par \uc2  At 0530 GMT (1:30 a.m. EDT), the Stock Exchange of Thailand index was 8.05 points lower to 620.50. This is down from its high of 625.94 and up from a low of 612.82 points. \par \par \uc2  The SET 50 Index is 0.72 point lower at 46.40. \par \par \uc2  At midday, declining shares are outnumbering advances 150 to 72, on a trading volume of 77.2 million shares worth 1.72 billion baht. \par \par \uc2  'There's some nervousness about \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  throughout the whole region,' said a dealer with Dhana Siam Finance & Securities PCL. 'People think the baht could fall further after the Philippines and Indonesia made their \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  more flexible.' \par \par \uc2  The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2 , meanwhile, said it would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stop the dollar rising above 30 baht. \par \par \uc2  Concerns over the financial health of small-to-medium sized commercial banks are also weighing on investors' minds. \par \par \uc2  On Friday rumors started circulating that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was to close down five of these banks. The Bank of Thailand has strenuously denied the market talk, but dealers said investors are still uneasy over the situation. \par \par \uc2  Thai Farmers Bank PCL is 2 baht lower at 103, with Thai Airways PCL down 4 baht to 51. Bangkok Bank PCL is 3 baht higher at 165. \par \par \uc2  (END) DOW JONES ASIAN EQUITIES REPORT  14-07-97 \par \par \uc2  0554GMT \par \par \uc2  5048 55107 \par \par \uc2 Dokument aer0000020011004dt7e00xj8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
