\par\par \b \uc2  Thailand Economic Planning Agency Sees '97 GDP Up 4.6% \b0\par\par\uc2 264 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Juli 1997\par 12:43\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  BANGKOK (AP-Dow Jones)--Thailand's economy will grow 4.6% in 1997, assuming the Thai \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  can be kept from depreciating more than 10%, the government's main economic planning agency said Monday. \par \par \uc2  The preliminary forecast by the National Economic & Social Development Board is the government's first since the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was implicitly devalued July 2. Previously the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  forecast growth of 5.9%, down from 6.4% in 1996. The forecast was presented Monday to Prime Minister Chavalit Yongchaiyudh and his advisors. \par \par \uc2  Wirat Wattansiritham, the NESDB's secretary-general, did not explain why the government had assumed a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  depreciation of 10%. Since July 2, the baht has depreciated 14% against the dollar in domestic markets, and more offshore. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's reference rate was 29.945 baht to the dollar Monday, up from 29.155 baht Friday. The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Thailand\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prevent the dollar from rising above 30 baht, but some economists say they expect the dollar to climb to 33 baht by the end of the year. \par \par \uc2  The NESDB said inflation should rise to 6 to 6.1% in 1997 from 5.8% in 1996, assuming a 10% baht depreciation. Under the same assumptions, it said, exports should grow 9.7% in 1997 after a 0.2% decline in 1996. It said the current-account deficit should shrink to 5 to 5.5% of the gross domestic product, down from 6% in 1996. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 14-07-97 \par \par \uc2  1043GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt7e054jl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
